The residual gives a cleaner route: the frozen method call is already carried as a symbolic Boolean value (`applyMethod(V, …) = AL0:Bool`). The invariant only failed because it compared that fixed result with a separate code-summary function. I’m deleting the projection abstraction and defining each key predicate as `truthy` of the frozen `applyMethod` term; under the Boolean equality, it reduces to the exact stored result.
apply patch
